            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat class bernama Player dan cetak variabel <code>level</code> di dalam definisinya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  level = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(level)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>class</code>, diikuti oleh <code>Player:</code>, lalu <code>print</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>level</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 89795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan pernyataan print yang berada <strong>di dalam</strong> definisi class untuk menampilkan variabel <code>show</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TV_Show\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  show = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spongeob Circleshirt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  channel = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nickelodeon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(show)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Spongeob Circleshirt\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>print(show)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
